{"id":"9a375244351119bb","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes.md","title":"The Book’s Sigma-0, Sigma-1, and Positive Sigma Classes","display":"df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes — The Book’s Sigma-0, Sigma-1, and Positive Sigma Classes","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes"],"display":"df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes — The Book’s Sigma-0, Sigma-1, and Positive Sigma Classes","source":"第 IV 章 pp. 41–42（PDF 58–59）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes — The Book’s Sigma-0, Sigma-1, and Positive Sigma Classes"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章 pp. 41–42（PDF 58–59）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6511106aac2e96b7\" href=\"?note=6511106aac2e96b7\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-truth\">92-df-smullyan-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_A,\\mathrm{FV}_E,\\operatorname{True}_E,\\operatorname{Inst}_E^k\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_A,\\mathrm{FV}_E,\\operatorname{True}_E,\\operatorname{Inst}_E^k\\)</span> 为原书无指数文法及标准真值/实例化。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_E=V_E\\cup\\{\\nu_n^E:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(C_E=V_E\\cup\\{\\nu_n^E:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_E=\\{v_i^E:i\\geq1\\}\">\\(V_E=\\{v_i^E:i\\geq1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1,R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\">\\(k\\geq1,R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_E^0,\\mathcal S_E^1,\\mathcal S_E^+\">\\(\\mathcal S_E^0,\\mathcal S_E^1,\\mathcal S_E^+\\)</span> 是以下定义的公式集合；指数 0、1、+ 不是字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_E\">\\(\\Sigma_E\\)</span> 的下标。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}classes}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nA_E^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{c_1+c_2=c_3,\\ c_1\\cdot c_2=c_3,\\ c_1=c_2,\\ c_1\\leq c_2:c_1,c_2,c_3\\in C_E\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{bdall}_{E,i,c}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall v_i^E(v_i^E\\leq c\\supset F),\\\\\n\\operatorname{bdex}_{E,i,c}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg_E\\operatorname{bdall}_{E,i,c}(\\neg_E F)\n\\quad(c\\in C_E,\\ v_i^E\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_E(c)),\\\\\n\\mathcal S_E^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_A:A_E^0\\subseteq U,\\\n\\forall F,H\\in U\\;\\neg_E F,F\\supset H\\in U,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\forall i,c\\;\\forall F\\in U\\;[c\\in C_E\\land v_i^E\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_E(c)\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bdall}_{E,i,c}(F)\\in U]\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal S_E^1&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\exists_E v_i^E F:i\\geq1,F\\in\\mathcal S_E^0\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal S_E^+&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_A:\\mathcal S_E^0\\subseteq U,\\\n\\forall F,H\\in U\\;F\\land_E H,F\\lor_E H\\in U,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15mm}\\forall F\\in U\\;\\forall i\\geq1\\;\\exists_E v_i^E F\\in U,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15mm}\\forall F\\in U\\;\\forall i,c\\;[c\\in C_E\\land v_i^E\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_E(c)\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bdall}_{E,i,c}(F),\\operatorname{bdex}_{E,i,c}(F)\\in U],\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15mm}\\forall D\\in\\mathcal S_E^0\\;\\forall F\\in U\\;(D\\supset F)\\in U\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Expr}_E^k(F,R)&amp;\\leftrightarrow F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_A\\land\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)\\subseteq\\{v_1^E,\\ldots,v_k^E\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15mm}\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;[\\vec n\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{True}_E(\\operatorname{Inst}_E^k(F;\\vec n))],\\\\\n\\mathcal R_E^{\\epsilon,k}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\exists F\\in\\mathcal S_E^\\epsilon\\;\n\\operatorname{Expr}_E^k(F,R)\\}\\quad(\\epsilon\\in\\{0,1,+\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}classes}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nA_E^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{c_1+c_2=c_3,\\ c_1\\cdot c_2=c_3,\\ c_1=c_2,\\ c_1\\leq c_2:c_1,c_2,c_3\\in C_E\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{bdall}_{E,i,c}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall v_i^E(v_i^E\\leq c\\supset F),\\\\\n\\operatorname{bdex}_{E,i,c}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg_E\\operatorname{bdall}_{E,i,c}(\\neg_E F)\n\\quad(c\\in C_E,\\ v_i^E\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_E(c)),\\\\\n\\mathcal S_E^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_A:A_E^0\\subseteq U,\\\n\\forall F,H\\in U\\;\\neg_E F,F\\supset H\\in U,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\forall i,c\\;\\forall F\\in U\\;[c\\in C_E\\land v_i^E\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_E(c)\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bdall}_{E,i,c}(F)\\in U]\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal S_E^1&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\exists_E v_i^E F:i\\geq1,F\\in\\mathcal S_E^0\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal S_E^+&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_A:\\mathcal S_E^0\\subseteq U,\\\n\\forall F,H\\in U\\;F\\land_E H,F\\lor_E H\\in U,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15mm}\\forall F\\in U\\;\\forall i\\geq1\\;\\exists_E v_i^E F\\in U,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15mm}\\forall F\\in U\\;\\forall i,c\\;[c\\in C_E\\land v_i^E\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_E(c)\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bdall}_{E,i,c}(F),\\operatorname{bdex}_{E,i,c}(F)\\in U],\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15mm}\\forall D\\in\\mathcal S_E^0\\;\\forall F\\in U\\;(D\\supset F)\\in U\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Expr}_E^k(F,R)&amp;\\leftrightarrow F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_A\\land\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)\\subseteq\\{v_1^E,\\ldots,v_k^E\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15mm}\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;[\\vec n\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{True}_E(\\operatorname{Inst}_E^k(F;\\vec n))],\\\\\n\\mathcal R_E^{\\epsilon,k}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\exists F\\in\\mathcal S_E^\\epsilon\\;\n\\operatorname{Expr}_E^k(F,R)\\}\\quad(\\epsilon\\in\\{0,1,+\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有 bounded 构造的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 必须是数码或不同变量，不能偷用一般复合项作原书的界。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_E^0\">\\(\\mathcal S_E^0\\)</span> 是本书规范化的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0\">\\(\\Sigma_0\\)</span> 文法；本地 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^G\">\\(\\Delta_0^G\\)</span> 允许更一般的项和界项，二者不是字面相同的公式集合。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_E^+\">\\(\\mathcal S_E^+\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0\">\\(\\Sigma_0\\)</span> 前件下对蕴涵封闭，且不对任意否定封闭。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_E^1\">\\(\\mathcal S_E^1\\)</span> 用一个无界存在量词；多个存在见证可由外部最大值合并。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_E^{\\epsilon,k}\">\\(\\mathcal R_E^{\\epsilon,k}\\)</span> 是标准模型表达的关系类，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 中的证明论表示类。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-truth","status":"resolved","id":"6511106aac2e96b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_A,\\mathrm{FV}_E,\\operatorname{True}_E,\\operatorname{Inst}_E^k","display":false},{"tex":"C_E=V_E\\cup\\{\\nu_n^E:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"V_E=\\{v_i^E:i\\geq1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1,R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S_E^0,\\mathcal S_E^1,\\mathcal S_E^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}classes}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nA_E^0&\\coloneqq\\{c_1+c_2=c_3,\\ c_1\\cdot c_2=c_3,\\ c_1=c_2,\\ c_1\\leq c_2:c_1,c_2,c_3\\in C_E\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{bdall}_{E,i,c}(F)&\\coloneqq\\forall v_i^E(v_i^E\\leq c\\supset F),\\\\\n\\operatorname{bdex}_{E,i,c}(F)&\\coloneqq\\neg_E\\operatorname{bdall}_{E,i,c}(\\neg_E F)\n\\quad(c\\in C_E,\\ v_i^E\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_E(c)),\\\\\n\\mathcal S_E^0&\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_A:A_E^0\\subseteq U,\\\n\\forall F,H\\in U\\;\\neg_E F,F\\supset H\\in U,\\\\\n&\\hspace{20mm}\\forall i,c\\;\\forall F\\in U\\;[c\\in C_E\\land v_i^E\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_E(c)\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bdall}_{E,i,c}(F)\\in U]\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal S_E^1&\\coloneqq\\{\\exists_E v_i^E F:i\\geq1,F\\in\\mathcal S_E^0\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal S_E^+&\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_A:\\mathcal S_E^0\\subseteq U,\\\n\\forall F,H\\in U\\;F\\land_E H,F\\lor_E H\\in U,\\\\\n&\\hspace{15mm}\\forall F\\in U\\;\\forall i\\geq1\\;\\exists_E v_i^E F\\in U,\\\\\n&\\hspace{15mm}\\forall F\\in U\\;\\forall i,c\\;[c\\in C_E\\land v_i^E\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_E(c)\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bdall}_{E,i,c}(F),\\operatorname{bdex}_{E,i,c}(F)\\in U],\\\\\n&\\hspace{15mm}\\forall D\\in\\mathcal S_E^0\\;\\forall F\\in U\\;(D\\supset F)\\in U\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Expr}_E^k(F,R)&\\leftrightarrow F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_A\\land\n\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)\\subseteq\\{v_1^E,\\ldots,v_k^E\\}\\land\\\\\n&\\hspace{15mm}\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;[\\vec n\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{True}_E(\\operatorname{Inst}_E^k(F;\\vec n))],\\\\\n\\mathcal R_E^{\\epsilon,k}&\\coloneqq\\{R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\exists F\\in\\mathcal S_E^\\epsilon\\;\n\\operatorname{Expr}_E^k(F,R)\\}\\quad(\\epsilon\\in\\{0,1,+\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S_E^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S_E^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S_E^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_E^{\\epsilon,k}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":3093,"backlinks":[{"id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本文把空集另列，避免用不存在的总函数值域表示空集。原书正 Σ/Σ₁ 表达路线见 [[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse]]；Σ₁ 与 c.e. 的标准正常形等价是递归论背景，不能把标准模型表达直接当作系统内逐例正负可证明性。"},{"id":"d754a154b50a9533","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 Σ₀ 只准变量/数码作规范原子参数，界也只准数码或不同变量。本地 Δ₀ 允许任意无指数复合项和界项，因此“也称 Σ₀”指通常层级惯例，不表示原书两个字符串集合相同；精确原书文法见 [[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]]。"},{"id":"17f36b05a2fd2754","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"以下是外部关系的有界算术展开，$\\leq$ 和乘法是原书无指数原语；关系类见 [[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]]。"},{"id":"cc77d3ecb4f82cf1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"无指数算术化：[[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]] → [[92-df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation]] → [[92-df-smullyan-base-parts]] → [[92-df-smullyan-frames]] → [[92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma]]。"},{"id":"08d7841178f7293b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c056f7fa0375bc62","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cf0f2611d5bc4db4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal S_E^0$ 是 [[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]] 的原书规范化 Σ₀ 公式类；$\\mathrm{Sent}_A,\\operatorname{True}_E$ 见 [[92-df-smullyan-truth]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]]"},{"id